### Admin User Management APIs

Admin endpoints for creating driver, employee, and consumer users. These are protected by the `role:admin,ceo` middleware.

#### 17. Create Driver User

Creates a user with `role=driver` AND creates the `garbage_truck_drivers` profile record in a single transaction.

```http
POST /api/admin/users/driver
Authorization: Bearer {admin_token}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstname": "John",
    "lastname": "Sangma",
    "email": "john.driver@example.com",
    "password": "password123",
    "dob": "1990-05-15",
    "phone_no": "9876543210",
    "ward_id": 1,
    "locality": "Tura Main",
    "driver_license_number": "ML-2024-12345",
    "license_expiry": "2027-12-31",
    "truck_id": 1
}
```

**Request Body:**

| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
|-----------|------|----------|-------------|
| `firstname` | string | Yes | First name (2-50 chars) |
| `lastname` | string | Yes | Last name (2-50 chars) |
| `email` | string | Yes | Unique email address |
| `password` | string | Yes | Minimum 6 characters |
| `dob` | string | Yes | Date of birth (`YYYY-MM-DD`) |
| `phone_no` | string | Yes | Phone number (min 10 digits) |
