| `license_expiry` | string | Yes | License expiry date (`YYYY-MM-DD`, must be future) |
| `truck_id` | int | No | Truck ID to assign (must exist in `garbage_trucks`) |

**Response (201):**
```json
{
    "status": "success",
    "message": "Driver created successfully",
    "data": {
        "user": {
            "id": 798,
            "firstname": "John",
            "lastname": "Sangma",
            "email": "john.driver@example.com",
            "phone_no": "9876543210",
            "dob": "1990-05-15",
